extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5qkSvEY0BWAQ7kNvwFhi1ev&_nc_oc=Adq7iwHzhpC12JDUAuHeYTRH0I4ZAQhl69IHs9Jk0rvifQtKF5X5slvZ0fAKV7cP4qs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIehoYztCKr0GzyYrCMSUmNdIJBT4ba4FbY-dVzk6AH8w&oe=6AAFF9D6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U4-DGrX8HcsQ7kNvwH8aDh1&_nc_oc=AdpQVPGomUAerM3I82RDsKYbKSrHNWBeL82RmaMFIh6Q4i1KxF5mUSBsLmgHB3M9VzI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKMqTTPPMb0yA9Mw3VtqElsts_qL8V94c0ZzZdewOU0Aw&oe=6AB00122"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oBK9MVjqv1UQ7kNvwGkSp25&_nc_oc=Adrs1PNq6RpcUHcXv1Hn54hZ276tkucqQuZ0PYDyGFiK1hfqxIF73Q8tRInufvODD34&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJWd6poXYpFjbauyescEy2ErXz_0N-ZqQKgVgns5SkySA&oe=6AAFD0D9"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":